    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.completion\n\n### Description\n\nHi, thanks for this great project!\n\nI'm currently experimenting moving my config to `mini.nvim` and coming from https://github.com/neoclide/coc.nvim one thing I miss is icons on the completion menu, https://github.com/onsails/lspkind.nvim is also a good example of how it could look like.\nCould something like that be added to `mini.completion`?",
